WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,160
The first step is to falsely report turnover

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,120
You make two thousand a year selling fish

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,640
Then package it to make five thousand

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,880
Let the other party think that this fish pond is a golden mountain

5
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:13,650
The second step is to play hard to get

6
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:15,880
Life and death does not agree to the transfer

7
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,960
I would rather cause trouble than take over the five wastelands.

8
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:21,160
Make the other person want it more and become more anxious

9
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:25,070
The third step: the golden shovel comes out of the body

10
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,470
Just find an intermediary and say you can't handle it anymore.

11
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,830
Fish ponds can be transferred at a high price

12
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:30,750
The condition is that the original frog fields must be replaced by Han fields.

13
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:31,950
Re-rented to large tenants

14
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:34,350
Then you take the money and move to town to open a restaurant

15
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,060
Such a way to make money

16
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,500
Smart people are indispensable

17
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,380
Next year there will definitely be people all over the mountains and plains renovating fish ponds

18
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,820
Pingli Youtian’s son-in-law took over the deal at a high price

19
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,880
Don’t even think about getting your money back in ten years

20
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,940
Did you go into the mountains for something, sister?

21
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:04,220
Why do you hurt me? In the mountains

22
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:05,620
Have you ever met a fox?

23
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:08,940
There is no such thing as yellow leather

24
00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:13,830
I come from a hunting background and don’t believe in that kind of wife.

25
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:18,030
I heard that if you rush into anything in the mountains, you can wake up with a slap. If you shoot me first, the mountain tiger must be a bully.

26
00:01:18,070 --> 00:01:22,790
I just know if he was rushing for something, sister.

27
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,240
I just used to be playful and didn’t like studying

28
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:34,750
It doesn't mean I'm stupid. Even your junior high school diploma is our father's

29
00:01:34,830 --> 00:01:36,230
I gave him ten kilograms of meat in exchange for it.

30
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:38,340
Brother, you used to have that fishy head of yours.

31
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:41,170
Sister, you can come up with such a plan

32
00:01:41,250 --> 00:01:43,770
Can you please stop holding on to this matter? I'm just being playful.

33
00:01:43,850 --> 00:01:47,690
It's not like I'm out of my mind. If this fish pond can really be sold for a high price,

34
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:49,890
You can tell the truth when you use money to do business

35
00:01:50,090 --> 00:01:51,570
The days of eating in the fields while watching the sky

36
00:01:51,770 --> 00:01:52,730
Brother-in-law has already done enough

37
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:54,630
It's just that you said opening a restaurant

38
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:56,630
I don’t know how to cook either, brother-in-law

39
00:01:56,950 --> 00:02:03,080
Who says you have to know how to cook to open a restaurant? If you have live fish at home and don’t have any in the fish pond, prepare a big iron plate.

40
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,880
Soybean oil, dried chili, potatoes, onions, green onions

41
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:07,260
Ginger Carrot Tiger Seed

42
00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:11,230
What do you think this has to do with opening a restaurant? Sister, just wait and see.

43
00:02:12,390 --> 00:02:15,470
Today I will teach you two how to cook this dish

44
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:19,840
That's enough for you to gain a foothold in the town. Don't ask.

45
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:26,140
Hu Zi said that he was confident and quickly prepared for his eldest brother-in-law in his previous life.

46
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:28,500
I have relied on this dish to make my fortune all my life.

47
00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:30,900
I allowed him to embark on this right path several years in advance.

48
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:34,240
As long as the eldest sister and her family stand firm in advance

49
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,320
From now on, he will be the strongest backing of our old Ma family.
